:''Not to be confused with [[Chocolate_Rabbits#Beach_Rabbits|Oasis]], a Beach Faction Rabbit.''

The '''{{Zone|Oasis}}''' is a large area of the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}}. It serves as a place to find {{MobSprite|Rabbit}}s and {{MobSprite|Sheep}}, harvest {{Item|Cocoa Beans}}, and go [[Fishing]] for {{MobSprite|Oasis Sheep}} and {{MobSprite|Oasis Rabbit}}s.

{{ZoneText|Fish in the pond.}}

== Location ==
The '''Oasis''' features multiple jungle trees and logs that {{Item|Cocoa Beans}} grow on. There is a lake which is surrounded by {{Item|Sugar Cane}} which is obtainable by the players. There is very little {{Item|Sand}} and no {{Item|Cactus|text=Cacti}} in the area. {{MobSprite|Rabbit}}s and {{MobSprite|Sheep}} naturally spawn in the area, and {{MobSprite|Oasis Sheep}} and {{MobSprite|Oasis Rabbit}}s can be [[Fishing|fished]] up there.

